// Deliberately carries no EXPECT marker, for the same reason as
// 41_reference_reject.adl: this is correctly rejected (see the printed
// "Can't find name looking for Surname" diagnostic below - Employee's
// unnamed alias "! Surname;" hides it from here down), but like every
// other semantic check in start_object(), that's print-only and doesn't
// currently affect the exit code - the parse still fully succeeds
// grammatically. Mark this test properly once errors are propagated
// through a proper ErrNum (see cpp/ToDo).
TOP {
	Person: {
		Surname:;
	}
	Employee: Person {
		! Surname;
	}

	// Faulty: Surname is hidden from Employee's own point of view, so this
	// search must not find it (unlike 71_alias_hide.adl's "Person.Surname",
	// which goes through Person directly and is unaffected).
	x: Employee.Surname;
}
